    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a fair point. i guess i'm wondering if we can even call it \"growth\" if it didn't actually benefit most people. like, if wealth just concentrates at the top and the middle class shrinks, isn't the whole \"growth\" argument basically just a way to mask the fact that the economic system became fundamentally broken for the average person?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
